ystem remained Efficient, even with the verification step. The Computer_terminal messages clarify no execution was done but the *actions* were still performed. Therefore, the **ideal** score is fully justified.\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

